  "ruleText": "Env-C 802.08 “DataCheck Tool results letter” means the document issued by the department with the results to an applicant’s request for a screening of the DataCheck Tool.\n\nSource. #14374, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25; ss by #14473 (formerly Env-C 802.06), eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES 1-19-36",
